          "argument_optional": false,
          "summary": "Use an alternate module file",
          "detail": "Supply a file ending in .mod. A go.mod must still exist to identify the module root. Go uses an alternate checksum file beside it, for example review.mod with review.sum. Workspace mode can restrict this flag.",
